Z||000000||2FAST4U||12-12-1999||02:18 AM||||If any one is interested - the GM Performance Parts book lists many hi performance parts for the 60 degree V-6. Crate motor, iron & aluminum blocks(starter can be mounted on either side), aluminum heads, cams and kits, ETC.<BR>The part number for the book is 12496739 and you can get on at just about any GM parts counter. Cost is $6.95<BR>If you can't or don"t want to get the book and just have a question about a part, just ask and I'll look it up for you.<P>[This message has been edited by 2FAST4U (edited 12-12-1999).]<p>[This message has been edited by 2FAST4U (edited 12-12-1999).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||David||12-12-1999||11:37 AM||||The book is also on-line at one of the GM sites in a .PDF form.  I forget the address, but remember that it was easy to find.||||reg||1
Z||000002||fierosound||12-12-1999||12:28 PM||||There's only 5 pages dealing with the V6 60 degree engine.  Save your money and download it instead from this site:<P> <A HREF="http://www.gmgoodwrench.com/parts/performance_top_frame.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.gmgoodwrench.com/parts/performance_top_frame.htm</A> <P><BR>Scroll down the list, you want to download 144-148.pdf<P>||||reg||10
